## Evaluation Strategy. 
Primary metrics focus on Macro-F1 and Accuracy for the main task, comparing the Multi-Task model directly against a Single-Task baseline (trained on the primary task only).
Since HateXplain is not perfectly balanced, Macro F1 is the most important metric. It gives equal importance to:
- Normal
- Offensive
- Hate Speech
This prevents the model from looking good simply because it predicts the majority class well.


